', CHAR(13), '
The range exists in productive tension with the Opus X at the top of the Fuente catalog. Where the Opus X is the house at maximum intensity — full Dominican power, Dominican grown wrapper, demanding and extraordinary — the Maduro offers a parallel argument: that Brazilian tobacco over the same Dominican filler base can produce a completely different kind of complexity, one built around sweetness and depth rather than power and spice.') AS BINARY), CAST(`history_en` AS BINARY)) > 0, REPLACE(`history_en`, CONCAT('', CHAR(13), '
', CHAR(13), '
The range exists in productive tension with the Opus X at the top of the Fuente catalog. Where the Opus X is the house at maximum intensity — full Dominican power, Dominican grown wrapper, demanding and extraordinary — the Maduro offers a parallel argument: that Brazilian tobacco over the same Dominican filler base can produce a completely different kind of complexity, one built around sweetness and depth rather than power and spice.'), ''), `history_en`),
  `history_es` = IF(LOCATE(CAST('

La gama existe en tensión fecunda con el Opus X, en la cima del catálogo Fuente. Allí donde el Opus X es la casa en su intensidad máxima —plena potencia dominicana, capa dominicana, exigente y fuera de norma—, el Maduro propone un razonamiento paralelo: el tabaco brasileño, sobre la misma base dominicana, puede producir una complejidad de naturaleza muy distinta, levantada sobre la dulzura y la profundidad antes que sobre la potencia y la especia.' AS BINARY), CAST(`history_es` AS BINARY)) > 0, REPLACE(`history_es`, '

