', CHAR(13), '
') AS BINARY), CAST(`history_en` AS BINARY)) > 0, REPLACE(`history_en`, CONCAT('Perdomo''s Ecuador range builds its entire proposition around this sourcing choice. The wrapper is the product of high-altitude Ecuadorian cultivation, bringing to the blend a silkier texture and more pronounced oil content than standard Connecticut shade. Beneath it, a Nicaraguan Jalapa filler blend — lighter than what appears in the Perdomo 20th Anniversary, calibrated specifically to allow the wrapper to lead — delivers notes of cream, mild vanilla, and toasted grain without the weight that would overwhelm the Ecuador''s inherent delicacy.', CHAR(13), '
